    "body": "You did not ask for the 1.15 cap. I added it because the engine documentation for the only move-rate native used here, SET_PED_MOVE_RATE_OVERRIDE, states a maximum of 1.15. I should have said that instead of silently presenting it as your design. Values above 1.15 need a different, proven movement mechanism; this setting cannot honestly offer them through the current native.",
